{"seq":4,"slug":"dashboard-design","title":"仪表板设计","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/dashboard-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dashboard-principles","title":"仪表板设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/dashboard-design/dashboard-principles","wordCount":1944,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"interactive-visualization","title":"交互式可视化设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/dashboard-design/interactive-visualization","wordCount":2434,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-storytelling","title":"数据叙事与报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/dashboard-design/data-storytelling","wordCount":2213,"readingTime":9},{"seq":4,"slug":"interactive-viz","title":"交互式可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/dashboard-design/interactive-viz","wordCount":1464,"readingTime":6},{"seq":5,"slug":"storytelling-with-data","title":"数据叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/dashboard-design/storytelling-with-data","wordCount":1383,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 仪表板设计 简介\n\n本章探讨如何将单个图表组合为有效的数据仪表板，实现从数据展示到决策支持的跨越。仪表板不是图表的简单堆砌，而是需要精心设计的信息架构和交互体验。\n\n**仪表板设计原则**介绍仪表板设计的核心原则，包括信息层次设计、布局模式、关注度管理和移动端适配等方法论。\n\n**交互式可视化**讲解如何为数据仪表板设计有效的交互功能，涵盖筛选联动、钻取下探、工具提示和参数化查询等交互模式。\n\n**数据叙事**探讨如何用数据讲述有说服力的故事，包括叙事结构设计、关键洞察的视觉强调和面向不同受众的呈现策略。\n\n本章是全知识库的综合落点，把前三章的原理、图表与工具能力升级为多图协同的决策界面与数据故事。建议读者在掌握前三章的基础后学习本章。\n"}